    {
      "source": "Extract the body to a <code>Flux</code>.",
      "translation": "将主体提取到 `<code>Flux</code>`。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Extract the body to a <code>Mono</code>.",
      "translation": "将主体提取到 `<code>Mono</code>`。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Bind to this request and return an instance of the given type.",
      "translation": "绑定到此请求并返回给定类型的实例。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the configured <a href=\"../../../../../web/reactive/accept/ApiVersionStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.accept\"><code>ApiVersionStrategy</code></a>, or <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "返回配置的<a href=\"../../../../../web/reactive/accept/ApiVersionStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.accept\"><code>ApiVersionStrategy</code></a>，或<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "a mono containing either a constructed and bound instance of\n<code>bindType</code>, or a <a href=\"../../../../../validation/BindException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation\"><code>BindException</code></a> in case of binding errors",
      "translation": "包含已构造并绑定的 `<code>bindType</code>` 实例，或在绑定错误时包含一个 `<a href=\"../../../../../validation/BindException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation\"><code>BindException</code></a>` 的 Mono。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> as of 5.1 this method ignores <code>\"Forwarded\"</code>\nand <code>\"X-Forwarded-*\"</code> headers that specify the\nclient-originated address. Consider using the <code>ForwardedHeaderFilter</code>\nto extract and use, or to discard such headers.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 自 5.1 版本起，此方法会忽略指定客户端源地址的<code>\"Forwarded\"</code>和<code>\"X-Forwarded-*\"</code>标头。建议使用<code>ForwardedHeaderFilter</code>来提取并使用或丢弃此类标头。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> calling this method causes the request body to\nbe read and parsed in full, and the resulting <code>MultiValueMap</code> is\ncached so that this method is safe to call more than once.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 调用此方法会导致请求体被完整读取和解析，生成的 <code>MultiValueMap</code> 会被缓存，因此可以安全地多次调用此方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: Manipulating the exchange directly (instead of using the methods provided on\n<code>ServerRequest</code> and <code>ServerResponse</code>) can lead to irregular results.",
      "translation": "注意：直接操作交换（而不是使用 `<code>ServerRequest</code>` 和 `<code>ServerResponse</code>` 上提供的方法）可能会导致不规则的结果。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Always guaranteed to return an instance either matching the session id\nrequested by the client, or with a new session id either because the client\ndid not specify one or because the underlying session had expired.",
      "translation": "始终保证返回一个实例，该实例要么匹配客户端请求的会话 ID，要么具有新的会话 ID（因为客户端未指定会话 ID 或底层会话已过期）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use of this method does not automatically create a session.",
      "translation": "使用此方法不会自动创建会话。",
      "count": 2
    },
